: "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 366985, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PuzxhA4M6yJuaGYmLdnT7R", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 366985, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PuzxhA4M6yJuaGYmLdnT7R", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 369073, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01N7tLMQLuFUUxSPsHgXWdBE", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build of payments-service was failing in tests/test_money.py::test_half_even.\n\n`round_money` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 require banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`). For example, `Decimal(\"2.665\")` rounded to 2.67 instead of the expected 2.66.\n\nChange: switch the rounding mode in `src/money.py` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. No other code changed.\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-pr-fix-banker-rounding"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 369973, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01N7tLMQLuFUUxSPsHgXWdBE", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fin-212-pr-fix-banker-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 369973, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01N7tLMQLuFUUxSPsHgXWdBE", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 371545, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as the requested reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 and the docstring call for banker's rounding. Under half-up, `Decimal(\"2.665\")` rounds to 2.67 instead of the expected 2.66.\n- **Change:** Switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`. It's a one-line change, and nothing else was modified.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n\nI did not merge anything. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner, so the PR is waiting on that review.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the source and the test to see what's expected.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01GdjYgvWjXPYktViXskkMSC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Rd3q5n4CfmE2jzRFvJnx3D", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: `round_money` uses `ROUND_HALF_UP` while its docstring and the test require `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Under half-up, 2.665 becomes 2.67 instead of 2.66. I'll create a branch and make the fix there.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012QUeV1npXm5m4HQ5Ro2ERV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MbTzL9iit3hf1eDQvZfNVG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The fix is committed. Next I'll start CI on the branch and wait for the result.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FESRgBDGmhMvGbA4iH7pkR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-banker-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PuzxhA4M6yJuaGYmLdnT7R", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "CI passed on the branch. I'll open the pull request against main and request review from alex.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01N7tLMQLuFUUxSPsHgXWdBE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build of payments-service was failing in tests/test_money.py::test_half_even.\n\n`round_money` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 require banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`). For example, `Decimal(\"2.665\")` rounded to 2.67 instead of the expected 2.66.\n\nChange: switch the rounding mode in `src/money.py` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. No other code changed.\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-pr-fix-banker-rounding"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as the requested reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 and the docstring call for banker's rounding. Under half-up, `Decimal(\"2.665\")` rounds to 2.67 instead of the expected 2.66.\n- **Change:** Switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`. It's a one-line change, and nothing else was modified.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n\nI did not merge anything. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner, so the PR is waiting on that review.", "type": "text"}]}]}